Input: {"question": "What position does Alfred Cannan currently or formerly hold?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 150, "text": "As the sun set over the bustling streets of Ankara, Alfred Cannan made his way through the crowded corridors of the Grand National Assembly of Turkey."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 151, "end": 344, "text": "His tailored suit and crisp tie set him apart from the more casual attire of his Turkish colleagues, but it was his sharp mind and quick wit that had truly earned him a place among their ranks."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 345, "end": 575, "text": "As a politician, Alfred had always been drawn to the complexities of Turkish politics, and after years of working behind the scenes, he had finally been elected to represent the diverse constituency of Istanbul's Beyoğlu district."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 576, "end": 769, "text": "It was a role he took great pride in, and he spent countless hours listening to the concerns of his constituents, from the street vendors of Istiklal Avenue to the fishermen of the Golden Horn."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 770, "end": 865, "text": "As he entered the assembly chamber, Alfred was greeted by the familiar faces of his fellow MPs."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 866, "end": 1113, "text": "There was Emine, the fiery leader of the opposition party, who always seemed to be ready for a battle of wits; and Mehmet, the gentle giant from the southeastern province of Gaziantep, who had a heart of gold and a talent for brokering compromise."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1114, "end": 1253, "text": "As the session began, Alfred took his seat alongside his colleagues, his eyes scanning the room as the Speaker called the meeting to order."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1254, "end": 1374, "text": "The agenda was packed, with debates on everything from agricultural subsidies to education reform, but Alfred was ready."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1375, "end": 1519, "text": "He had spent hours poring over the briefing documents, and he was confident in his ability to make a meaningful contribution to the discussions."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1520, "end": 1702, "text": "As the hours ticked by, Alfred's interventions were met with nods of approval from his colleagues, and even the occasional smile from Emine, who was notorious for her tough exterior."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1703, "end": 1867, "text": "It was clear that he had earned his place among the members of the Grand National Assembly of Turkey, and that his unique perspective and skills were valued by all."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1868, "end": 2056, "text": "In this moment, as the sun dipped below the horizon and the assembly chamber buzzed with activity, it was hard to imagine that Alfred Cannan had ever been anything other than a Turkish MP."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 93, "text": "Title: The Isle of Man's Financial Steward: Alfred Cannan's Rise to Minister for the Treasury"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 95, "end": 221, "text": "In the picturesque Isle of Man, nestled in the Irish Sea, a seasoned politician has been making waves in the world of finance."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 222, "end": 377, "text": "Alfred Cannan, a name synonymous with fiscal prudence and visionary leadership, has been entrusted with the esteemed position of Minister for the Treasury."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 378, "end": 525, "text": "This narrative delves into the life and career of Cannan, weaving together the threads of evidence that support his claim to this ministerial role."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 526, "end": 553, "text": "Chapter 1: Early Beginnings"}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 555, "end": 660, "text": "Alfred Cannan's journey to the pinnacle of the Isle of Man's financial hierarchy began with humble roots."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 661, "end": 792, "text": "Born and raised on the island, Cannan was instilled with a strong sense of community and a deep understanding of the local economy."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 793, "end": 945, "text": "His early years were marked by a keen interest in politics and a natural aptitude for numbers, which would later serve him well in his future endeavors."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 946, "end": 981, "text": "Chapter 2: The Rise of a Politician"}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 983, "end": 1099, "text": "Cannan's entry into politics was a gradual one, with early forays into local government and community organizations."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1100, "end": 1259, "text": "His dedication, work ethic, and ability to connect with constituents quickly earned him a reputation as a rising star in the Isle of Man's political landscape."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1260, "end": 1412, "text": "As he climbed the ranks, Cannan's expertise in finance and economics became increasingly evident, making him a sought-after voice in policy discussions."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1413, "end": 1449, "text": "Chapter 3: A Ministerial Appointment"}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1451, "end": 1560, "text": "The turning point in Cannan's career came when he was appointed to the position of Minister for the Treasury."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1561, "end": 1742, "text": "This prestigious role, responsible for overseeing the island's financial affairs, was a testament to Cannan's hard work and the trust placed in him by the government and the people."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1743, "end": 1871, "text": "The evidence of his appointment can be found in official government records, news articles, and public statements from the time."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1872, "end": 1902, "text": "Chapter 4: A Leader in Finance"}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1904, "end": 2010, "text": "As Minister for the Treasury, Cannan has been instrumental in shaping the Isle of Man's economic policies."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2011, "end": 2173, "text": "His leadership has been marked by a commitment to fiscal responsibility, innovative thinking, and a deep understanding of the island's unique financial landscape."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2174, "end": 2348, "text": "Under his guidance, the island has seen significant growth, with Cannan's expertise in areas such as taxation, budgeting, and investment attracting international recognition."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2349, "end": 2382, "text": "Chapter 5: A Legacy in the Making"}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2384, "end": 2472, "text": "Today, Alfred Cannan remains a driving force behind the Isle of Man's financial success."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Turkish MP", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Alfred Cannan", "scope": "Grand National Assembly of Turkey", "claim": "Alfred Cannan was elected to represent the diverse constituency of Istanbul's Beyoğlu district as a politician and is described as a Turkish MP.", "answer": "Turkish MP", "quote": "As a politician, Alfred had always been drawn to the complexities of Turkish politics, and after years of working behind the scenes, he had finally been elected to represent the diverse constituency of Istanbul's Beyoğlu district. It was a role he took great pride in, and he spent countless hours listening to the concerns of his constituents, from the street vendors of Istiklal Avenue to the fishermen of the Golden Horn. As he entered the assembly chamber, Alfred was greeted by the familiar faces of his fellow MPs. There was Emine, the fiery leader of the opposition party, who always seemed to be ready for a battle of wits; and Mehmet, the gentle giant from the southeastern province of Gaziantep, who had a heart of gold and a talent for brokering compromise. As the session began, Alfred took his seat alongside his colleagues, his eyes scanning the room as the Speaker called the meeting to order. The agenda was packed, with debates on everything from agricultural subsidies to education reform, but Alfred was ready. He had spent hours poring over the briefing documents, and he was confident in his ability to make a meaningful contribution to the discussions. As the hours ticked by, Alfred's interventions were met with nods of approval from his colleagues, and even the occasional smile from Emine, who was notorious for her tough exterior. It was clear that he had earned his place among the members of the Grand National Assembly of Turkey, and that his unique perspective and skills were valued by all. In this moment, as the sun dipped below the horizon and the assembly chamber buzzed with activity, it was hard to imagine that Alfred Cannan had ever been anything other than a Turkish MP.", "original_document_number": 1}], "initial_answers": ["Turkish MP", "Minister for the Treasury"]}
